00:17:24,520 --> 00:17:26,530
lies in being impartial, fair,

280
00:17:26,280 --> 00:17:28,410
and ensuring orders are followed.

281
00:17:28,240 --> 00:17:30,000
Not in fighting amongst ourselves

282
00:17:30,080 --> 00:17:31,520
or trying to be brave.

283
00:17:32,000 --> 00:17:33,960
You'd better remember this.

284
00:17:34,880 --> 00:17:37,520
This subordinate was reckless...

285
00:17:38,000 --> 00:17:40,400
I beg Commander Wang's forgiveness !

286
00:17:41,520 --> 00:17:42,880
You are not qualified

287
00:17:43,480 --> 00:17:44,880
to be my enemy.

288
00:17:45,880 --> 00:17:47,600
We pay respects to the Commander !

289
00:17:48,080 --> 00:17:49,680
We pay respects to the Commander !

290
00:17:50,040 --> 00:17:51,640
We pay respects to the Commander !

291
00:18:04,680 --> 00:18:06,450
All of you are dismissed.

292
00:18:06,880 --> 00:18:07,720
Understood !

293
00:18:09,160 --> 00:18:12,570
Third Army Barracks
Ancient Demon City

294
00:18:16,960 --> 00:18:18,400
I failed again...

295
00:18:19,960 --> 00:18:22,170
If it weren't for the Blood Soul Pills,

296
00:18:21,560 --> 00:18:24,730
Blood Soul Pills

297
00:18:22,160 --> 00:18:24,040
I would have died 4 times already...

298
00:18:27,200 --> 00:18:29,370
I don't have many chances left.

299
00:18:29,520 --> 00:18:31,200
I must not fail in the task

300
00:18:31,760 --> 00:18:33,640
