301
00:18:35,120 --> 00:18:38,520
If only I knew someone skilled in restrictions to help me,

302
00:18:39,120 --> 00:18:41,530
I'm sure I would succeed in a single try.

303
00:18:54,680 --> 00:19:00,570
I've been walking this path for endless years

304
00:18:56,980 --> 00:19:00,570
just to catch a glimpse of your silhouette.

305
00:19:00,960 --> 00:19:06,170
Is it the compass of fate

306
00:19:02,800 --> 00:19:06,170
that wrote this outcome for us ?

307
00:19:06,080 --> 00:19:12,090
The heavens want to erase your existence,

308
00:19:11,960 --> 00:19:17,810
that's the obsession guiding me.

309
00:19:17,840 --> 00:19:23,410
Is this the path to uncover

310
00:19:19,720 --> 00:19:23,410
truths from falsehoods ?

311
00:19:23,440 --> 00:19:29,010
In a world of murk and shadow,

312
00:19:25,340 --> 00:19:29,010
only the flame of truth can light the way.

313
00:19:28,800 --> 00:19:34,730
Look at them all,

314
00:19:31,680 --> 00:19:34,730
being carried by the waves.

315
00:19:34,920 --> 00:19:39,370
Look at them all,

316
00:19:37,080 --> 00:19:39,370
being drowned.

317
00:19:39,200 --> 00:19:42,690
I don't want to believe in whoever decides fate,

318
00:19:42,480 --> 00:19:45,770
I will let the world refine my soul.

319
00:19:45,650 --> 00:19:51,330
So what if I become an Immortal and defy the heavens ?

320
00:19:47,340 --> 00:19:51,330
I will fight.

321
00:19:51,080 --> 00:19:54,450
I'll break through the abyss of despair

322
00:19:54,200 --> 00:19:57,490
to finally learn who I really am.

323
00:19:57,240 --> 00:20:02,850
My body is stained by the bloody color of slaughter,

324
00:19:59,120 --> 00:20:02,850
I embrace this obsession.

325
00:20:02,600 --> 00:20:05,810
I won't glance back at the wasteland I left behind.

326
00:20:05,560 --> 00:20:08,610
Even if this suffering shatters my soul

327
00:20:08,360 --> 00:20:14,090
and I'm reborn countless times in hell,

328
00:20:10,400 --> 00:20:14,090
I'll still fight.

329
00:20:14,040 --> 00:20:17,450
It's hard to avoid loneliness

330
00:20:17,200 --> 00:20:20,490
when you are above everyone else.

331
00:20:20,240 --> 00:20:26,170
Can a moth that has witnessed the flames of a Suzaku

332
00:20:22,560 --> 00:20:26,170
be afraid of a firefly ?
